+# Solution
+
+`redact` uses one precompiled, case-insensitive ASCII regular expression to find complete API-key tokens with the specified prefixes and at least 12 alphanumeric characters, replacing each match with `***`.
+
+The input is processed line by line with line endings preserved. Lines whose first token starts with `DEBUG_` are returned unchanged; every other line is redacted globally.
+
+One aspect of the specification is worth noting: its statement that masking is unconditional across the entire input conflicts with the later operational exception for `DEBUG_` loggers. The implementation treats the explicit exception as overriding the general rule.
